* ===== L1->L2 INTERSTAGE: BIAS + ReLU + OUTPUT (64 channels) =====
* Bias: calibrated transistor mirrors from self-biasing master reference
* Self-biasing 1uA reference: R from VDD sets current through NFET diode
* R_bias = 1.182M calibrated for I_ref = 1.0uA (SKY130 BSIM4 tt corner)
* NFET master: R -> NFET diode (sets nbias_master_n gate voltage)
R_bias_n vdd nbias_master_n 1.182Meg
Xbias_master_n nbias_master_n nbias_master_n 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=2.0u L=0.5u
* PFET master: PFET diode + NFET mirror (mirrors 1uA from nbias)
Xbias_master_p pbias_master_p pbias_master_p vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=2.0u L=0.5u
Xn_mirror_p pbias_master_p nbias_master_n 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=2.0u L=0.5u

